{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415019","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415019","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041501901:1":{"text":"오, 비페리안! 실험은 잘 돼?","source_cn":"哦，维珀里安，最近实验顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CBC4D562C36BC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501902:1":{"text":"잘 되냐고? 아니, 오히려 반대야. 대규모 실험을 해야 하는데, 쓸만한 녀석이 없어.","source_cn":"顺利？不，恰恰相反，我需要大型实验，但根本找不到可用之才。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00DCF9366A42FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501903:1":{"text":"쓸모없는 녀석은 진작에 처리했고, 그나마 가능성 있어 보이는 놈을 추려서 간신히 사람 만들어 놨어. 하지만 내 조수라고 하기엔 수준이 너무 낮아.","source_cn":"我处理了好几拨没用的废物，才总算调教出一批勉强能派上用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB93C4022A56DBEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501904:1":{"text":"어제만 해도 멍청한 녀석들이 실험 재료를 잘못 선택하는 바람에 소중한 영혼들이 서로를 잡아먹고 난리도 아니었어. 내가 발견했을 땐 영혼들이 이미 절반밖에 남지 않았지!","source_cn":"结果这帮蠢货，昨天选错了实验材料，一大批宝贵的灵魂被临...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE3441FF16F39C0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501905:1":{"text":"하하, 쓸모없는 조수는 차라리 나에게 넘기는 건 어때?","source_cn":"呵呵，要是那批手下不好用，不如移交给我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D81206E334A7F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501906:1":{"text":"내 영혼의 낫이 굶주린 지 오래되었거든...","source_cn":"这柄敛魂的镰刀，已经饥渴难耐了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3C021BBBF75D47A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:尼汝":{"text":"니루","source":"尼汝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维珀里安":{"text":"비페리안","source":"维珀里安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}